  <h1>About {{ business.name }}</h1>
  <p>
    {{ business.name }} opened with one mixed-age classroom and has grown, slowly and
    on purpose, into four. We've never wanted to be the biggest school in town — just
    a place where a three-year-old and a six-year-old can work at the same table
    without either of them being bored or overwhelmed.
  </p>
  <p>
    Every lead guide is certified for their classroom's age range, and class sizes
    stay small enough that guides actually know each child's work, not just their
    name. If you're curious what a typical day looks like, a visit tells you more
    than this page can — <a href="/contact/">reach out</a> to schedule one.
  </p>
